  "body": "The JavaScript Standard has accomplished its goal. Some remaining web compatibility issues are tracked over at https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/labels/web%20reality, to which https://javascript.spec.whatwg.org/ now redirects. The rest of the contents of the JavaScript Standard have been upstreamed into ECMAScript, Annex B.\n\nhttps://blog.whatwg.org/javascript\n\nFixes #1660.\n",
